# Shipping Daily 18 AUG 2026 p.1 share-price table (ONE daily, one vintage — the
# WORKFLOWS §Consensus-pair recapture discipline). NOT APPLIED: promotion is the
# owner's deliberate step. THIS IS THE 2343 STATIC-FALLBACK FIX (PLAN 8/18 URGENT):
# tonight's 8/18 fetch prints 2343 $0.51 = +31.4% vs the 0.39 static — the ±30%
# guard RE-TRIPPED, so the name is valuing on the stale 7/14 static AGAIN. The
# whole-book variant fires because fresh dailies landed 8/17 + 8/18 (PLAN: "whole-
# book rebase if a fresh Pareto daily has landed"; the 8/14 daily never printed —
# recorded single-day gap, archive_gaps decision at the 8/16 close stands).
# On promote: rebase price + consensus_pnav + consensus_fwd_pe TOGETHER into
# watchlist.yaml with as_of 2026-08-18; APPROX names keep flags (price+PE only);
# names ABSENT from Pareto's table (TEN / SB / CMDB / GSL) keep their current
# static pair untouched; 2343 promotes via the issuer_sourced lane below.
# kr-quoted rows (BRUT / CAPT / BWLP / MPCC) are transcribed AS PRINTED — apply
# the standing FX conversion at promote: NOK/USD 0.106322 (2026-08-18, committed
# prices_daily @ e8395ac — the DAILY's-date FX per the codified 2026-08-09 rule;
# note the table's Last-price rows are Mon-8/17 closes, same off-by-one the 8/07
# precedent carried with its 8/07 FX).

